// Direct verification probe for `compiler.abi.stability` and `compiler.abi.fingerprint`
// (T867 / E20.5: SPEC-114 §§1..3 & §6, REQ-ECO-8734, REQ-PKG-022, REQ-PKG-024, INV-SABI-001, INV-SABI-002).

